        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CBN625SBR, Acrylic Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Acrylic Cabinet Pull is available in 5 inch, 7 inch, 9 inch, or 11 inch lengths. The grip is made from high-quality acrylic and you can choose from frosted of clear. The mounts are made from brass and they are available in a huge array of finishes. The First Impressions Cabinet Pull has a modern look that makes it a great choice for contemporary homes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Acrylic Cabinet Collection Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mount Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CBN01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262332\"><b>First Impressions CBN625SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CBN625005SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: .85\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CBN625007SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: .85\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CBN625009SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: .85\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CBN625011SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: .85\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
